Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 10:28:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: align canonical domain with www redirect target, remove
 stale static sitemap

- NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL and fallbacks now point to https://www.regentplatform.com
  to match the actual redirect target (bare domain -> www), fixing the
  canonical/redirect mismatch causing GSC 'Page with redirect' and
  'Alternate page with proper canonical tag' issues.
- Removed stale public/sitemap.xml (referenced old regent.systems domain and
  was missing current pages). It was silently shadowing the dynamic
  src/app/sitemap.ts route since Next.js serves static /public files over
  app-router routes at the same path.
---
