 public/sitemap.xml | 16 ----------------
 src/app/layout.tsx |  2 +-
 src/app/robots.ts  |  2 +-
 4 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 public/sitemap.xml

